						Count: 1b
						tag: {
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Hello and welcome to my modpack, Strictly Medieval. Now i know most of you won't want to read a bunch of text so i will get right to the point of this book. \\nQuests:\\nBefore you start your adventure here in your world, go through each chapter for the skills and \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Unlock the beginning portions of the chapters.\\nMeaning \\\"checkmark\\\" quests you just click the checkmark to start the chapter.\\n\\nSome Chapters are not starting for a reason that you must craft a specific item to start this chapter.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"For example, fishing needs you to craft and complete the fishing rod quest in the Crafting Tab. (i have removed a lot of these dependencies as of lately, but just make sure to follow the quests in order!)\\n\\nThe biggest question i get is \\\"this quest isn't \\nworking\\\" So please\\n\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"make sure you have completed the quest before it AND in the order the lines follow.\\n\\nPS ONLY a Vanilla Crafting table will work for crafting quests. TINKERS will not work.\\n\\nGood luck and feel free to join the discord for any help \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"you may need!\\n\\nhttps://discord.gg/JACwUXYNZ6\"}"
							]
							title: "任务简介 Intro to Quests"
							author: "Orangejewce92"
